    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "3 bedroom semi detached house with detached garage located in lovely mature private estate. Ideally positioned close to local primary and second level schools, gym and swimming pool and district shopping centre. Easy access to M.1 interchange and within walking distance of Boyne river walk and Oldbridge house and parklands. No.12 has been beautifully maintained through the years and offers bright airy accommodation throughout.\r\nAccommodation briefly includes; entrance hall, sitting room, kitchen/dining room, conservatory, 3 bedrooms & bathroom. To rear is a large detached garage ideal for conversion to home office etc. The house has the benefit of backing on to local GAA club and therefore not overlooked. A great option for family seeking a solid traditional house in sought after location.\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall: 3.76 x 1.88\r\nlaminate wood floor, under stairs cloakroom\r\nSitting room: 3.78 x 3.93\r\nFeature marble fireplace, coving\r\nKitchen: 5.91 x 3.01\r\nFitted units, tiled splashback\r\nConservatory: 2.88 x 2.42\r\ndoor to garden\r\nBedroom 1: 2.6 x 2.88\r\nfitted wardrobe\r\nBedroom 2: 3.78 x 3.2\r\nfitted wardrobe\r\nBedroom 3: 4.14 x 3.1\r\nBathroom: 1.75 x 2.24\r\nbath, electric shower, wc, whb, tiled bath area\r\nGarage: 5.94 x 2.54\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n1. Oil fired central heating\r\n2. upvc double glazed windows\r\n3. Walled private rear garden\r\n4. Large side entrance\r\n5. Front garden and driveway"
      },
      {
